export anchor NightSwimStyle:
    number: 391
    screen: FitnessTracker
    name: Night swim
    idea: An outdoor pool under night floodlights, seen from above, where the screen is four lanes split by bead lane ropes, numbered from the starting blocks, with a round pace clock for the run and rings filled like water levels.
    base: dark
    palette:
        deck: #14191c, the tiled pool deck, page and style sheet
        tile: #20272b, deck tile joints
        water: #05212d, the pool and the sheet basins
        lane: #072a39, alternate lanes and list rows
        floor: #021118, lane floor lines, tube insides, fields and inner panels
        ink: #eefaff, text and figures
        muted: #a3cad6, labels, tube outlines and passed plan weeks
        cyan: #7fe0ff, water levels, zone bars, laps, the Done tag, primary button and focus
        onCyan: #02202a, text on cyan
        coral: #ff8f80, rope beads, the pace hand, the top zone, today and the current week
        ropeWhite: #f2fbff, rope beads and the secondary button edge
        block: #e9eef0, starting blocks, lane numbers, the pool coping and sheet tabs
        onBlock: #0c1418, numbers on blocks
    type:
        One geometric stack, Futura, Century Gothic, URW Gothic, Avenir
        Next, Trebuchet MS, system-ui. Pace in the clock is 34px bold, lane
        figures 28px, block numbers 22px, lane labels 13px caps tracked
        0.16em, body 15px at 1.5.
    layout:
        A tiled deck page with a 48px tile grid. The header has a wave mark,
        Brightwork Move, square Today, Week and Plan tabs with Today in
        white, and the date with lights on. Four white starting blocks
        numbered 1 to 4 sit above the pool. The pool has a 10px light
        coping, floodlight glows at the top and four lanes side by side
        split by bead lane ropes in coral, white and teal, with dark T
        shaped floor lines behind. Lane 1 Rings shows three tall water tubes
        for Move, Exercise and Stand, filled to their percent with a wavy
        surface and a dashed goal line at the top, names, values and goals
        below, and a note on what is left. Lane 2 Evening run has a Done
        tag, a round pace clock with sixty ticks, a coral hand on 9 seconds
        and 5 min 9 s per km in the centre, then four figure tiles. Lane 3
        Zones and laps holds zone bars with zone 3 in coral, then the week
        as seven lap rows with day, bar and km, rest days dotted with rest
        and today in coral. Lane 4 At the wall holds Sleep 7 h 12 min with
        deep sleep, the Half marathon at week 6 of 12 with twelve lap ticks,
        five filled, one coral and six hollow, the next session tomorrow
        Long run 14 km, and View plan. Below 1100px the blocks hide, lanes
        stack and ropes run across, with lane numbers on white tiles before
        each heading.
    spacing: An 8px unit. Lanes with 20px padding, 14px between panels, 10px lane ropes.
    density: Medium. Four lanes side by side, each holding one or two panels.
    corners: 10px panels, 12px water tubes, 4px blocks, pills for buttons, fields and tags.
    borders: A 10px light coping around the pool, bead lane ropes between lanes and 1px teal panel edges.
    shadows: None. Floodlight glows sit in the water at the top.
    icons:
        A wave mark, lane numbers on blocks, a pace clock with a red hand,
        water tubes with a dashed goal line and a check in the Done tag.
        Rest days have a dotted line and the word rest. Passed plan weeks
        are filled, the current one coral and future ones hollow.
    focus: A 3px cyan outline offset 3px.
    tone: Pool words such as water level, At the wall, laps and to the line.
